{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/http/09_폴링/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h1 id=\"04-추가-프로토콜\" style=\"position:relative;\">04. 추가 프로토콜<a href=\"#04-%EC%B6%94%EA%B0%80-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%ED%86%A0%EC%BD%9C\" aria-label=\"04 추가 프로토콜 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://github.com/jeonghwan-kim/lecture-http\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/jeonghwan-kim/lecture-http</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>🔗 <a href=\"https://jeonghwan-kim.github.io/2024/07/10/lecture-http-part4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://jeonghwan-kim.github.io/2024/07/10/lecture-http-part4</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>HTTP의 비연결성을 극복하는 다양한 기술</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>9장. 폴링: 클라이언트가 주기적으로 서버에 요청을 보내서 새로운 데이터를 확인하는 방법</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>10장. 롱 폴링: 폴링보다 효율적인 통신 기법</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>11장. SSE: 서버가 클라이언트로 실시간 데이터를 푸시하는 방법</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>12장. 웹 소켓: 클라이언트와 서버 간의 양방향 통신 프로토콜</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"9장-폴링\" style=\"position:relative;\">9장. 폴링<a href=\"#9%EC%9E%A5-%ED%8F%B4%EB%A7%81\" aria-label=\"9장 폴링 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>클라이언트가 서버에게 지속적으로 HTTP 요청을 보낸다.</li>\n<li>polling (당기다)</li>\n<li>서버 자원이 민감한 환경에서는 이 기법을 신중하게 다뤄야 한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\">$ <span class=\"token function\">curl</span> http://localhost:3000/poll <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"9-1-구조\" style=\"position:relative;\">9-1. 구조<a href=\"#9-1-%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"9 1 구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>지속적인 요청으로 서버와 연결을 유지한다.</li>\n<li>네트워크 대역폭과 서버 자원을 낭비할 수 있다.</li>\n<li>비유: 새로운 소식이 있나요?</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-2-서버-구현\" style=\"position:relative;\">9-2. 서버 구현<a href=\"#9-2-%EC%84%9C%EB%B2%84-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84\" aria-label=\"9 2 서버 구현 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>채팅 어플리케이션 제작</li>\n<li>채팅 메시지 조회 기능</li>\n<li>채팅 메시지 전송 기능</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"9-3-클라이언트-구현\" style=\"position:relative;\">9-3. 클라이언트 구현<a href=\"#9-3-%ED%81%B4%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EC%96%B8%ED%8A%B8-%EA%B5%AC%ED%98%84\" aria-label=\"9 3 클라이언트 구현 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>지속적으로 요청을 생성\n<ul>\n<li>setTimeout</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>수신한 메시지를 출력</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-X</span> POST http://localhost:3000/update ^\r\n  <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-H</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Content-Type: application/json\"</span> ^\r\n  <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--data</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"{<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\&quot;\">\\\"</span>text<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\&quot;\">\\\"</span>:<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\&quot;\">\\\"</span>hello<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\&quot;\">\\\"</span>}\"</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"9-4-중간정리\" style=\"position:relative;\">9-4. 중간정리<a href=\"#9-4-%EC%A4%91%EA%B0%84%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC\" aria-label=\"9 4 중간정리 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTP 연결을 유지하기 위해 주기적으로 요쳥을 만드는 기법</li>\n<li>특징: 단순한 구현</li>\n<li>주의사항 1: 네트웍과 서버 자원을 낭비할 수 있다.</li>\n<li>주의사항 2: 지연 시간 (실시간성 저하)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"참고\" style=\"position:relative;\">참고<a href=\"#%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\"참고 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ko.javascript.info/long-polling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">롱 폴링 | JAVASCRIPT.INFO</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"예제\" style=\"position:relative;\">예제<a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"예제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p><strong>파일구조</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>/ch09\n<ul>\n<li>public\n<ul>\n<li>favicon.ico</li>\n<li>index.html</li>\n<li>script.js</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>shared\n<ul>\n<li>message.js</li>\n<li>serve-static.js</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>server.js</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">pollServer</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token constant\">INTERVAL_MS</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">fetch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'/poll'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>status <span class=\"token operator\">===</span> <span class=\"token number\">204</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pollServer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token constant\">INTERVAL_MS</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> message <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">json</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">render</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n  <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>pollServer<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token constant\">INTERVAL_MS</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">render</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> messageElement <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">createElement</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'div'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> text <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> message<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> timestamp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Date</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">toLocaleTimeString</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  messageElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>textContent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token template-string\"><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>text<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> (</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">${</span>timestamp<span class=\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">)</span><span class=\"token template-punctuation string\">`</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n  document<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>body<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">appendChild</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>messageElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\